o class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523460/extras/21509b8368fb841ebcaa3aeb9f87dcc3.poster.avif?t=1773516236\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523460/extras/21509b8368fb841ebcaa3aeb9f87dcc3.webm?t=1773516236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523460/extras/21509b8368fb841ebcaa3aeb9f87dcc3.mp4?t=1773516236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Immerse yourself in a Bodycam first-person survival backrooms game. Unforgiving, systematic, and clinical, the game will challenge you at every step. Scavenge liminal worlds for valuables and resources; you will need them to survive ruthless encounters with their entities.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523460/15ec6e225cf32bfd17171537af03744a92d1c00c/header.jpg?t=1773516236", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523460/37183eb84d53c4965378eb02342c5ede83ecad5b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773516236", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523460/37183eb84d53c4965378eb02342c5ede83ecad5b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773516236", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 3000 series or Intel equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD RX 5700 or Nvidia equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 22 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": []